OL,3,GNEWSAFilm shows what happened after the
OL,4,ADambusters raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FRare footage highlighting a
OL,7,Flittle-known aspect of the Dambusters
OL,8,Fraid has gone on show.
OL,10,FWhile many people are familiar with the
OL,11,Foutline of the World War Two mission `
OL,12,Fwhen the RAF used "bouncing bombs" to
OL,13,Fdestroy German dams ` historians say
OL,14,Fthe story of what happened next is not
OL,15,Fwidely understood.
OL,17,FAfter Me, The Flood, an exhibition at
OL,18,Fthe International Bomber Command
OL,19,FCentre, Lincoln, highlights the
OL,20,Fcasualties on both sides of the attack
OL,21,Fon the Mohne Dam, including at least
OL,22,F1,300 people killed in flooding.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
