OL,3,GNEWSAFilm shows what happened after the
OL,4,ADambusters raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman archivist Lena Lewald said: "The
OL,7,Fbombing of the dam has been a very
OL,8,Fsuccessful feat of engineering, but
OL,9,Fthere's so much more that needs to be
OL,10,Fadded to have the full story."
